OL,3,GNEWSAMan tracks down siblings who sent
OL,4,Ahim Christmas present as he fled war 33
OL,5,Ayears ago
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man forced to flee war in Croatia as
OL,8,Fa child has used social media to find
OL,9,Fand thank the siblings from Wales, who
OL,10,Fsent him a Christmas present more than
OL,11,F30 years ago.
OL,13,FDalibor Sentic was 10 when in the early
OL,14,F1990s his family fled the newly
OL,15,Findependent country - which had
OL,16,Frecently become involved in the Balkan
OL,17,Fwar - for Stockholm, Sweden.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
