OL,3,GNEWSAMan tracks down siblings who sent
OL,4,Ahim Christmas present as he fled war 33
OL,5,Ayears ago
OL,6,
OL,7,FDalibor had received a gift from two
OL,8,Fyoung siblings, eight-year-old Claire
OL,9,Fand Peter, six, from Mold, Flintshire,
OL,10,Fand had hoped to track them down but
OL,11,Fonly had limited information on them.
OL,13,FDecades later, Dalibor, now 44, was
OL,14,Fable to find the pair to thank them,
OL,15,Fsaying the gesture had "meant a lot" at
OL,16,Fa time of great difficulty.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
